Queuelib release notes
======================

Version 1.11.0
--------------
(unreleased)

* Added a ``shared`` argument to ``FifoSQLiteQueue`` and
  ``LifoSQLiteQueue`` to use the same database file from several queue
  objects at once, including from different processes. In shared mode
  ``pop()`` is atomic (an item is read and deleted in one transaction and
  returned only after it commits) and ``close()`` keeps the database file
  even when it is empty
* Added a ``lock_timeout`` argument to ``FifoSQLiteQueue`` and
  ``LifoSQLiteQueue`` to bound the wait for a database lock; a timeout now
  raises ``sqlite3.OperationalError`` instead of looking like an empty queue

Version 1.10.0
---------------
(released on 2026-08-24)

* Added ``clear()``, to remove every item from a queue while keeping it open
* Fixed ``RoundRobinQueue.pop()`` dropping falsy items
* Added support for Python 3.15
* Improved linting and CI configuration

Version 1.9.0
-------------
(released on 2026-01-29)

* Added support for Python 3.14
* Removed support for Python 3.9 and PyPy 3.10
* Improved linting and CI configuration

Version 1.8.0
-------------
(released on 2025-03-31)

* Added support for Python 3.13 and PyPy 3.11
* Removed support for Python 3.8
* Queue classes now accept ``os.PathLike`` paths
* Fixed test failures on Windows
* Switched the build system to ``hatchling``
* Improved linting and CI configuration


Version 1.7.0
-------------
(released on 2024-05-04)

No functionality changes with respect to 1.6.2

* Added support for Python 3.10-3.12 and PyPy 3.10
* Removed support for Python 3.5-3.7
* Improved type annotations and added the ``py.typed`` file
* Added ``pre-commit`` configuration
* Improved linting and CI configuration


Version 1.6.2
-------------
(released on 2021-08-26)

No functionality changes with respect to 1.6.1

* Added `python_requires>=3.5` to `setup.py`
* Formatted the codebase with `black`
* Added type annotations
* Added CI checks for typing, security and linting


Version 1.6.1
-------------
(released on 2021-04-21)

No code changes with respect to 1.6

* Migrate CI to GitHub actions
* Fix release


Version 1.6
-----------
(released on 2021-04-21)

* Add peek support
* Remove py2 support
* Full test coverage


Version 1.0
-----------
(released on 2013-04-23)

First release of Queuelib.
